sequenceDiagram
    participant Spring as Spring
    participant WebConfiguration as WebConfiguration
    participant HeaderTenantInterceptor as HeaderTenantInterceptor
    participant InterceptorRegistry as InterceptorRegistry
    participant DispatcherServlet as DispatcherServlet

    Spring->>WebConfiguration: Instantiate WebConfiguration
    Note right of Spring: Spring creates WebConfiguration bean with HeaderTenantInterceptor dependency
    activate WebConfiguration
    WebConfiguration-->>Spring: Configuration bean instance
    deactivate WebConfiguration

    Spring->>WebConfiguration: addInterceptors(registry)
    Note right of Spring: Spring calls addInterceptors during MVC configuration
    activate WebConfiguration
    WebConfiguration->>InterceptorRegistry: addInterceptor(headerTenantInterceptor)
    Note right of WebConfiguration: Register HeaderTenantInterceptor with InterceptorRegistry
    activate InterceptorRegistry
    InterceptorRegistry->>InterceptorRegistry: Store interceptor in registry
    Note right of InterceptorRegistry: Interceptor added to internal registry list
    InterceptorRegistry-->>WebConfiguration: InterceptorRegistration
    deactivate InterceptorRegistry
    WebConfiguration-->>Spring: void
    deactivate WebConfiguration

    Spring->>DispatcherServlet: Initialize DispatcherServlet(interceptors)
    Note right of Spring: Interceptor becomes active in request processing pipeline
    activate DispatcherServlet
    DispatcherServlet-->>Spring: void
    deactivate DispatcherServlet